{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEAL THE PIG \u2014 a cooperative platformer where you play as two thieves trying to steal a pig. Be careful, because this pig isn\u2019t one who enjoys traveling! Try not to wake it up or let it escape! Get ready for tons of fun, unexpected situations, and a real test of teamwork.  <br>The game is inspired by projects like Split Fiction, It Takes Two, and Chained Together, but with a unique atmosphere and its own approach to co-op.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/1.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single-player, split-screen, and multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo, in split-screen mode on one device, or invite a reliable friend to an online lobby to steal the pig together! Teamwork will help you overcome all challenges and deliver the pig safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/2.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traps and puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll encounter traps and puzzles that will test your skills and reflexes. Bravely solve challenges and avoid dangers to successfully deliver the pig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/3.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover mini-games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every corner of the map to find and unlock fun and unexpected mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/7.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Physics at every step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, everything works according to the laws of physics: mass, inertia, collisions\u2014it all matters! This makes the game not only exciting but truly unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/4.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variety of costumes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the costumes\u2014search for and gather unique outfits hidden in the most unexpected corners of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/6.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/Untitled_video_-_Made_with_Clipchamp__3___online-video-cutter.com___1_.gif?t=1747425589\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585400?t=1747425589","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585400?t=1747425589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/eacd486bb0e1942f28318d898264d41a13bdd3ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747425589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/eacd486bb0e1942f28318d898264d41a13bdd3ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747425589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3744000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEAL THE PIG \u2014 a cooperative platformer